Boot menu: fourth entry "LineageOS 24" (mainline kernel) from l24_boot

For the ios-sailfish submodule (ios/shim), NOT applied: proposal for
lineageos-24-mainline milestone M1 (PLAN.md section 5). android_boot() takes
the partition name; the new entry boots the same header-v2 format from the
GPT partition l24_boot. A mainline Image (text_offset 0) runs at 0x80000000.
axon7-bootmenu needs entry 3 ("l24") to go with it. Host test builds with
-Werror (cc -DANDROID_HOST_TEST ... host_android_test.c android.c fdtw.c) and
now checks the entry as 0x80000000 + the Image's text_offset (mainline: 0).

Apply in ios/:  patch -p1 < ../lineageos-24-mainline/shim/0001-boot-menu-fourth-entry-l24_boot.patch

